* PPIP - VERIFIED FILE COPY

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* PPIP - VERIFIED FILE COPY

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    SYSUTLS:PPIP [dir:]source [[dir:]destination]
    SYSUTLS:PPIP [destination=]source [options]

Copies a single specified file, with CRC verification by default in the
installed version. Example: SYSUTLS:PPIP I0:SOURCE.TXT I0:COPY.TXT

Do not use wildcards with this version. Some options move files or change
overwrite behavior; use the simple copy form unless deliberately
maintaining media. It is separate from DRI PIP and remains private.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
